### 知识抽取
POST http://localhost:8080/api/knowledge/extract
Content-Type: application/json

{"knowledgeBaseId":1,"sourceId":1,"text":"知识裁决是正式知识发布前的质量控制环节。低置信度知识必须人工审核。\n\n知识查询应按问题类型选择向量、BM25、知识卡片、断言和图谱。"}

### 查询
POST http://localhost:8080/api/knowledge/query
Content-Type: application/json

{"knowledgeBaseId":1,"query":"知识为什么需要裁决？","topK":10,"userId":"u001"}

### Outbox backlog
GET http://localhost:8080/api/knowledge/index/outbox/1/stats

### List outbox events (paged: items/total/page/size/totalPages)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/knowledge/index/outbox/1/page?page=1&size=20

### List dead outbox events
GET http://localhost:8080/api/knowledge/index/outbox/1/page?page=1&size=20&status=DEAD

### List dead outbox events (legacy array response)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/knowledge/index/outbox/1?status=DEAD&limit=50

### Replay a dead event
POST http://localhost:8080/api/knowledge/index/outbox/events/{{eventId}}/replay

### Skip a dead event (operator compensation)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/knowledge/index/outbox/events/{{eventId}}/skip

### 批量导入（多文件一次提交，返回批次号后台异步执行）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/knowledge/documents/batch-upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="knowledgeBaseId"

1
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="authorityScore"

0.9
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="permissionTags"

["team-a"]
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="01.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

< ./dataset/bastion-audit/01-堡垒主机账号与授权管理规范.md
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="02.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

< ./dataset/bastion-audit/02-堡垒主机高危命令清单与处置规范.md
--WebAppBoundary--

### 批量进度（轮询到状态不再是 RUNNING）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/knowledge/documents/batch/{{batchCode}}

### 批量批次列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/knowledge/documents/batches/1?limit=10

### 取消剩余文件
POST http://localhost:8080/api/knowledge/documents/batch/{{batchCode}}/cancel

### 重跑失败文件
POST http://localhost:8080/api/knowledge/documents/batch/{{batchCode}}/retry

### Check index count drift
GET http://localhost:8080/api/knowledge/index/drift/1
